From a738a3660d985d0f050a204fc2b4463efab41e7d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:33:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: always undo the page card when the tab sheet is gone

The page dim and scale were removed only on a progress-0 frame, so a
dismissed, detached, paused or re-moded sheet could leave the page
dimmed. restoreSheetChrome() is now the one idempotent restore (scale,
clip, backdrop, shade, status bar, scrim, url bar focus guard), driven
by whether the sheet window is actually on screen and called from every
close path.

Also fixes three bugs found on the way:
- Re-hosting the origin pill while it was the touch target re-added an
  attached view and crashed (child already has a parent). Detach is now
  safe and the rehost is posted while the pill touch is on the stack.
- Close all from the sheet finished the activity. It now opens a new tab
  first and closes the old tabs with undo.
- Closing the sheet by dragging it down could focus the omnibox.
